        <h3>Intro Fellowship</h3>
        <p class="item-body">Applications open at the start of every semester. We recommend joining if you want to learn how to do good in the world, especially with your career, but aren't sure how. Time commitment: two hours (one hour of preparation, one hour meeting) for five weeks.</p>
        <p class="learn-more"><a href="{{ '/get-involved/' | url }}">Learn more about the fellowship &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="program-item">
        <h3>Impact Lab</h3>
        <p class="item-body">For the fall 2026 semester, Impact Lab meetings are on Sundays from 2:00&ndash;3:00 pm in DUC 241. These meetings are open to anyone, including if you've never heard of the club or effective altruism. We discuss concepts in effective altruism and ways to have an impactful career.</p>
        <p class="learn-more"><a href="{{ '/impact-lab/' | url }}">Learn more about Impact Lab &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
